// TEST: Atan2 Magnitude Mismatch (rejects)
// ERROR: BL3999
// Same DIMENSION, different MAGNITUDE. atan2(1 day, 86400 second) is either 1
// or 1/86400 depending on a conversion factor, and an intrinsic call is not one
// of the seams (scalar +, -, comparisons) where Blade materializes one -- so it
// has to reject rather than pick. BL3999 is the same-dimensions-different-scale
// band, distinct from the BL3006 dimension mismatch in unit-errors/006.
Unit second
Unit day = 86400 * second
let t1: Float<day> = 1.0
let t2: Float<second> = 86400.0
let bad = atan2(t1, t2)
